  why: compares compile-time element names (AUDIO_SINK_ELEMENT); '!strcmp' idiom
clang-tidy: plugins/providers/telepathy/src/streamchannelhandler.cpp: Call to virtual method 'StreamChannelHandler::startedAt' during construction bypasses virtual dispatch [clang-analyzer-optin.cplusplus.VirtualCall]
  why: the handler classes are not subclassed; the call is meant to reach this class's own implementation
clang-tidy: plugins/providers/telepathy/src/streamchannelhandler.cpp: switching on non-enum value without default case may not cover all cases [bugprone-switch-missing-default-case]
  why: Tp::LocalHoldState: the pending states need no action, only held/unheld change the status
clang-tidy: src/cellbroadcaststore.cpp: repeated branch body in conditional chain [bugprone-branch-clone]
  why: two different conditions (geo check no longer needed / first presentable) lead to the same presentation state; kept separate for readability
clang-tidy: src/dbus/voicecallhandlerdbusadapter.cpp: The value '3' provided to the cast expression is not in the valid range of values for 'VoiceCallFilterAction' [clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange]
  why: deliberate: unknown D-Bus integers map to 3, inside the enumeration's value range ([dcl.enum]/8, two bits) but no action, so filter() rejects it
clang-tidy: src/dbus/voicecallhandlerdbusadapter.cpp: returning a constant reference parameter may cause use-after-free when the parameter is constructed from a temporary [bugprone-return-const-ref-from-parameter]
  why: QDBusArgument operator>> must return the const QDBusArgument & it was given; Qt's D-Bus marshalling signature
cppcheck: plugins/providers/ofono/src/ofonovoicecallhandler.h: Virtual function 'status' is called from constructor 'OfonoVoiceCallHandler(const QString&handlerId,const QString&path,OfonoVoiceCallProvider*provider,QOfonoVoiceCallManager*manager)' at line 74. Dynamic binding is not used. [virtualCallInConstructor]
  why: the handler classes are not subclassed; the call is meant to reach this class's own implementation
  why: false positive: QOfonoManager::isValid() is only declared in the header, cppcheck guesses its value
  why: false positive: 'new QOfonoManager(this)' passes the parent, nothing is converted to bool
